<title>MALAYSIA: Malakoff 6-mth net at 31.86 mln rgt.</title>
<headline>Malakoff 6-mth net at 31.86 mln rgt.</headline>
<dateline>KUALA LUMPUR 1997-05-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>Period to Feb 28</p>
<p>		   (in million ringgit unless stated)</p>
<p>    Net profit		  31.86   vs	   5.90</p>
<p>    Group shr (cents)	 14.3    vs	   2.7</p>
<p>    Turnover		   333.18   vs	   1.67</p>
